^{:go/end 241} (go/method load "load reads the operand at its size (or size when the operand has none); ok false: a fault (raised).\n" [^{:tag (* CPU)} c ^{:tag (* Inst)} in ^{:tag (* Opnd)} o ^uint8 size] :results [uint64 bool]
  (switch (.-K o)
    (case [OReg]
